# IMG-06 — picture element has fallback img

## Rationale

`<picture>` requires a fallback `<img>`; sources need `media` and/or `type` to be
useful.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check images <file>
```

Flags `<picture>` without a child `<img>`.

## How to fix

Propose adding the fallback `<img>` (with IMG-01 attributes) and `media`/`type`
on `<source>` elements.
